tests: wait for the first symlink target before rotating

Writing one hundred lines with one-millisecond sleeps does not guarantee
Promtail has discovered the first symlink target. Wait until all its lines
are received before replacing the symlink, then retain the final assertion
that both targets deliver all two hundred lines.

